# Git CLI

When running git in the terminal (e.g. status, pull, push, merge), use the system git explicitly:

- **Path**: `/usr/bin/git`
- Example: `/usr/bin/git status`, `/usr/bin/git pull origin main`

This ensures git is found even when xcode-select or PATH differs in the agent's shell.
